
# Subject above: imperative, sentence case, no period, 72 chars max (aim
# for 60). Optional prefix: a lowercase area ("paper: add ...") or
# "Attempt N: ..." for attempt-log commits.
#
# Leave the line after the subject blank, then explain why, not what,
# wrapped at 72 columns. For a correction, say what was wrong.
#
# Trailers go last, one per line, and may run past 72 columns:
#   Co-Authored-By: Name <email>
#   Claude-Session: https://...
#
# Lines starting with '#' are dropped. Conventions: docs/COMMITS.md
